# Mechanic: Continuous keyword grants retire with their source.
# Forcing: Remove both keyword sources before the final lethal spell.
# AI behavior: No hand or battlefield actions interrupt the removal sequence.
# Failure modes: Stale grants disagree with current creature abilities; timeout indicates a stalled response.
# Card roles: Cloudshredder grants flying and haste; Fervor independently grants haste;
# Sentinel Sliver receives both grants; Healer's Hawk keeps printed flying; Naturalize and two Bolts remove sources and win.
# Protocol path: AddAbility, LayeredEffectDestroyed, persistent deletion, and full-state projection.
